	* test/lisp/emacs-lisp/edebug-tests.el
	(edebug-tests--conflicting-internal-names): New test.
	* test/lisp/emacs-lisp/edebug-resources/edebug-test-code.el
	(edebug-test-code-cl-flet1): New test case.

