	Port recent rename changes to RHEL 7 + NFS

	Problem reported by Ted Zlatanov in:
	https://lists.gnu.org/r/emacs-devel/2017-08/msg00082.html
	* src/fileio.c (Frename_file): On RHEL 7 + NFS, renameat2 can fail
